entry.content:
## New: Bingo Goal Line Count
Added a new option that allows you to set how many lines you need to clear to achieve your bingo goal.
Before this the only option available was blackout.

## Changes:
* Adjustments to bingo goal logic to account for the new option;

## Fixes:
* Found a bug in one of the rules adding an extra '|' to the skill level location requires;

